<title>UK: HORSE RACING-ENGLISH ST LEGER RUNNERS AND RIDERS.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-ENGLISH ST LEGER RUNNERS AND RIDERS.</headline>
<dateline>DONCASTER 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Runners and riders for the </p>
<p>English St Leger, a group one classic for three-year-olds, to be</p>
<p>run over 14-1/2 furlongs (2.9 km) on Saturday (tabulate under</p>
<p>horse, trainer, jockey):</p>
<p> Clerkenwell     Michael Stoute	  Walter Swinburn</p>
<p> Desert Boy	Peter Chapple-Hyam    Willie Carson</p>
<p> Dushyantor	Henry Cecil	     Pat Eddery</p>
<p> Flying Legend   Henry Cecil	     Willie Ryan</p>
<p> Gordi	     Dermot Weld	     Kieren Fallon</p>
<p> Heron Island    Peter Chapple-Hyam    John Reid</p>
<p> Mons		Luca Cumani	     Oscar Urbina</p>
<p> Samraan	   John Dunlop	     John Carroll</p>
<p> Shantou	   John Gosden	     Frankie Dettori</p>
<p> Sharaf Kabeer   Saeed bin Suroor	Richard Quinn</p>
<p> St Mawes	  John Dunlop	     Kevin Darley</p>
<p> Wilawander	Barry Hills	     Richard Hills</p>
<p>Value to winning owner: 174,688 pounds sterling ($271,500)</p>
<p>Latest betting: 3-1 Dushyantor, 4-1 Mons, 6-1 Gordi, 8-1</p>
<p>Sharaf Kabeer, Shantou, St Mawes, 12-1 Clerkenwell, 14-1 and</p>
<p>upwards others.</p>
<p>Official off time: 1440 GMT.</p>
</text>
